B.Vc=new A.bb("m-bidding-laboronly","Labor-only jobs: how to bid","The customer supplies the parts. Quote labor only.",B.a5J)
B.XG=new A.aZ("Bid the realistic hours the diagnosis takes and your honest hourly rate. Once accepted, the hours and price are fixed. You cannot add time later.")
B.Z5=new A.aZ("Be clear in your note about what is included, for example scan, inspection or test drive.")
B.a9r=s([B.XG,B.Z5],t.f)
B.VT=new A.bb("m-bidding-diag","Bidding on diagnostics","Hours x rate. No add-ons.",B.a9r)
B.Yl=new A.aZ("All payments for jobs found on YCYC must go through YCYC. Do not accept or ask for cash, transfers or payment apps for a job that came from the platform, and do not take the customer off the platform to avoid fees.")
B.XO=new A.aZ("This protects both of you: it keeps a record, and it keeps your payment secured. Breaking this rule can lead to removal and held payouts.")
