B.Wc=new A.bb("m-payouts-fee","The 15% fee","YCYC keeps 15% of the job price. You keep the rest.",B.a5x)
B.a6q=s(["The customer's card is held when they accept your bid and pay.","After the work is done, the customer confirms and releases payment. The money is captured.","Your share goes to your Stripe account. Stripe then pays out to your bank or debit card on your payout schedule."],t.s)
B.Zm=new A.hf(B.a6q)
B.YU=new A.aZ("Bank timing is set by Stripe and your bank, usually a few business days. Check your Earnings screen for the status of each job.")
