B.V0=new A.bb("m-payouts-timing","When you get paid","Hold, capture, then Stripe pays you.",B.a6d)
B.YH=new A.aZ("If you have an eligible debit card on Stripe, you can cash out available funds instantly. The fee is 3% of the amount cashed out, with a minimum of 1 dollar. The exact fee and what you will receive are shown in the app before you confirm. Standard payouts to your bank on Stripe's normal schedule have no instant cash-out fee.")
B.Xt=new A.dP("Eligibility depends on Stripe and your card. Not all cards support instant payouts.")
