B.a9q=s(["A request to pay cash, send money by app, or pay anywhere outside YCYC.","A price that changes after you accepted, or pressure to approve extra work on the spot.","Someone who is not the mechanic you chose.","A bid far below every other bid with no explanation. Ask what is and is not included.","Anyone asking for your password, card number or a verification code. YCYC will never ask."],t.s)
B.WV=new A.dp(B.a9q)
B.XK=new A.aZ("If you see any of these, decline politely and tell us with 'Report a concern'.")
B.a73=s([B.WV,B.XK],t.f)
B.Vo=new A.bb("c-safety-scams","Spotting scams and red flags","Walk away if you see these.",B.a73)
B.ZQ=new A.hA("YCYC is not an emergency service. If you are in danger, or someone is hurt, call 911.")
B.YT=new A.aZ("After you are safe, report what happened using 'Report a concern' so we can act on it.")
B.a5i=s([B.ZQ,B.YT],t.f)
B.Vy=new A.bb("c-safety-emergency","Emergencies","Call 911. Then tell us.",B.a5i)
B.a6H=s([B.Vn,B.W1,B.Vo,B.Vy],t.fm)
B.Zw=new A.fY("Safety & privacy","Staying safe and keeping your information private",B.xi,B.a6H)
B.YR=new A.aZ("YCYC is a neutral platform. We cannot, and do not, recommend or endorse any specific mechanic or shop. Any badge, verification mark or review is information for you to weigh, not a promise about the quality of a repair.")
B.YM=new A.aZ("Every mechanic is an independent business responsible for their own work. The tips below are general guidance only. The final choice is always yours.")
B.a8G=s([B.YR,B.YM],t.f)
B.VF=new A.bb("c-choose-neutral","Your Car, Your Choice: what YCYC can and cannot tell you","We are neutral. We cannot endorse any mechanic or shop.",B.a8G)
B.Xa=new A.wz("Look at the whole picture")
B.a9e=s(["Reviews: read several, not just the star average. Look for comments about jobs like yours, honesty, and showing up on time.","Experience: years in the trade and the kind of work they list.","Certifications: ASE certificates that YCYC has reviewed show specific training. They do not guarantee a good result.","Insurance: a mechanic may show an insurance badge. It is information, not a guarantee that any claim will be paid.","Warranty: if a mechanic offers a warranty, ask exactly what it covers and for how long. It is between you and the mechanic.","Mobile or shop: decide whether you want work done at your place or at a shop."],t.s)
B.WU=new A.dp(B.a9e)
B.X9=new A.wz("Compare bids sensibly")
B.a8L=s(["Compare what each price includes: parts, labor, fluids, taxes.","Be careful with a bid far below the rest. Ask what is and is not included.","Check the arrival day and time fit your schedule."],t.s)
B.WA=new A.dp(B.a8L)
B.Xb=new A.wz("Trust your judgment")
B.a6t=s(["If a profile is thin or something feels off, pick another bid. There is no deadline to accept.","Keep everything in the app so you have a record and your payment protection."],t.s)
B.WN=new A.dp(B.a6t)
B.Xv=new A.dP("You can also open 'Tips on choosing the best mechanic for YOU' from the bids screen any time you are comparing bids.")
B.a7d=s([B.Xa,B.WU,B.X9,B.WA,B.Xb,B.WN,B.Xv],t.f)
B.Vr=new A.bb("c-choose-tips","Tips for choosing the best mechanic for you","Reviews, credentials, price, timing and communication.",B.a7d)
B.a7n=s(["Verified: YCYC has reviewed the mechanic's details before they could bid. It is not an endorsement of any particular repair.","ASE certified: one or more ASE certificates were uploaded and approved by YCYC. Check which ones.","Insurance: the mechanic uploaded proof of insurance that YCYC reviewed, and it has not expired. It is not a guarantee of coverage for your job.","Mobile service, Shop, Warranty offered, Accepts insurance jobs: what the mechanic says they offer."],t.s)
B.WQ=new A.dp(B.a7n)
B.Xj=new A.dP("YCYC reviews documents it is shown. We do not inspect work, and we cannot guarantee any mechanic.")
B.a5d=s([B.WQ,B.Xj],t.f)
B.Vd=new A.bb("c-choose-badges","What the badges and labels on a profile mean","Information to weigh, not guarantees.",B.a5d)
B.a7e=s([B.VF,B.Vr,B.Vd],t.fm)
B.ZC=new A.fY("Choosing a mechanic","General tips. The choice is always yours.",B.lW,B.a7e)
B.Z9=new A.aZ("You pay the job price you accepted plus YCYC's service fee of 5% of the job price. The total is shown before you confirm.")
B.XT=new A.aZ("Example: a 200 dollar job has a 10 dollar service fee, so your card is held for 210 dollars.")
B.Yi=new A.aZ("Additional work you approve, and any diagnostic, follow the same rules.")
B.a4Y=s([B.Z9,B.XT,B.Yi],t.f)
B.VJ=new A.bb("c-pay-fees","What you pay","The bid, plus a 5% service fee.",B.a4Y)
B.Y3=new A.aZ("When you accept a bid and pay, your card is authorized: the money is set aside but not paid out. It may show as pending. It is captured and paid out when you confirm the job is complete, when YCYC releases it after reviewing a problem, or automatically if the authorization is about to expire without a confirmation or a reported problem.")
B.Y2=new A.aZ("If a job is cancelled, only any applicable fee is captured and the rest of the hold is released back to your card. How fast your bank shows the release depends on your bank.")
B.a9l=s([B.Y3,B.Y2],t.f)
B.We=new A.bb("c-pay-hold","Hold vs charge","Your card is held first and charged when the job is done.",B.a9l)
B.a5r=s(["Cancel before paying: no fee.","Cancel after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held.","Cancel after you both confirmed work started: 50%.","Reschedule: 20% (mechanic arrived), 10% (on the way), 5% (not set off), of the job price, only if the mechanic approves.","Labor-only job cancelled by the mechanic for wrong or missing parts, or no one there: 20% of the job price.","Mechanic cancels or never shows up: you are not charged."],t.s)
B.WH=new A.dp(B.a5r)
B.a9_=s([B.WH],t.f)
B.Vx=new A.bb("c-pay-fees-table","Fees at a glance","Cancellation, rescheduling and parts fees in one place.",B.a9_)
B.a8z=s([B.VJ,B.We,B.Vx],t.fm)
B.ZB=new A.fY("Payments & fees","What you pay and when",B.jr,B.a8z)
B.Y6=new A.aZ("Go to Settings > Account & security to change your email or password, or delete your account. Deleting an account removes your personal details, but transaction records are kept for tax and accounting purposes.")
B.a6w=s([B.Y6],t.f)
B.Wb=new A.bb("c-account-manage","Changing your email, password, or deleting your account","Settings > Account & security.",B.a6w)
